:null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Change pushed to Gerrit for review: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1677. Awaiting LLM-Review and Verified votes.","timestamp":1786565413880843001}],"created_at":1786564563344205001,"creation_channel":"python","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c041696b-5fa8-43c9-aa94-3c20034a1737","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0226-4271-844a-459b"},{"link_uuid":"28e619f7-d6d9-40cf-bf93-2f16f4d809c5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"60c8-e833-aa73-43c7"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nIn `.github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml`, the `golden-path` job executes `sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y jq && jq --version` unconditionally on every run. On standard GitHub Actions `ubuntu-latest` runners, `jq` is already pre-installed out of the box, making the 15–30s `apt-get update` call redundant overhead.\n\n## Approach\nUse a conditional check `type jq >/dev/null 2>&1 || (sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y jq) && jq --version`. This evaluates `type jq` in <0.001s and skips `apt-get update` when `jq` is present, while safely falling back to package installation if executed on a minimal runner environment lacking `jq`.\n\n## Scope\n- `.github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml` (`golden-path` job step)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `.github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml` uses a conditional fallback check for `jq` installation in the `golden-path` job step.\n- [ ] `make lint` (ruff + actionlint + zizmor) passes.\n- [ ] `make typecheck` passes.\n- [ ] `python scripts/check_verify_gate_parity.py` passes.\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py` passes all 17 tests.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml","reason":"optimize jq setup step"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","0226-4271-844a-459b"],["relates_to","60c8-e833-aa73-43c7"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"ef5bc767-2cd9-4211-a4fb-cf68465d6109","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"35de-cf0b-5b04-4f0b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Avoid redundant apt-get update in gerrit-verify golden-path step when jq is present","verify_commands":[{"command":"grep -q \"type jq\" .github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml","dd_id":"AC1","dd_text":"conditional jq check in gerrit-verify.yaml"},{"command":"make lint","dd_id":"AC2","dd_text":"lint passes"},{"command":"make typecheck","dd_id":"AC3","dd_text":"typecheck passes"},{"command":"python scripts/check_verify_gate_parity.py","dd_id":"AC4","dd_text":"gate parity check passes"},{"command":"pytest tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py -q","dd_id":"AC5","dd_text":"workflow parity tests pass"}]},"source_event_uuids":["cbd889cc-793d-4c03-913f-2ef8d25fb5cb","12ad50ad-c859-4301-8d14-91d3e31eda94","3072f9ac-9aa8-4c14-96ba-46d9e6e6449a","c041696b-5fa8-43c9-aa94-3c20034a1737","337a77d8-53af-4f14-a7d4-1568490c8912","ef5bc767-2cd9-4211-a4fb-cf68465d6109","35fc37ce-cccc-46dd-acc8-6c666991d2db","05a8e155-21c2-4594-9eb1-42a62e896587","96ffc643-d4a8-4e35-af3e-cfb0fe280da0","28e619f7-d6d9-40cf-bf93-2f16f4d809c5"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786565599852503739,"uuid":"ee09a6bb-9af6-4adb-85d8-dbb7c898ca5b"}